WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.639
Renting a carnival ride?

2
00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:04.330
Here’s what to sort out before you sign.

3
00:00:04.757 --> 00:00:07.725
It’s a logistics job, not just a booking.

4
00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:11.630
Equipment, crew and schedule all shape the price.

5
00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:16.079
Before you call, have this ready: date, location,

6
00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:20.680
hours, crowd size, the rides you want, and truck access.

7
00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:23.170
And “I don’t know yet” is a normal answer.

8
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:26.410
Then ask every operator about seven things.

9
00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:29.414
Transport: is there a travel charge,

10
00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:31.930
and how long is setup and teardown?

11
00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:35.352
Power: does the ride need three-phase power?

12
00:00:35.636 --> 00:00:38.170
Is a generator, and fuel, included?

13
00:00:38.577 --> 00:00:41.277
Staffing: are ride operators included?

14
00:00:41.578 --> 00:00:44.450
How many hours, and what does overtime cost?

15
00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:47.407
Insurance: can they provide a certificate,

16
00:00:47.407 --> 00:00:49.950
and add your venue as additional insured?

17
00:00:50.287 --> 00:00:52.165
Permits: who applies?

18
00:00:52.443 --> 00:00:54.899
You, the venue or the operator?

19
00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:55.990
Ask early.

20
00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:58.837
Crew: hotel rooms or RVs?

21
00:00:59.119 --> 00:01:01.230
And where do the trucks park overnight?

22
00:01:01.756 --> 00:01:03.497
Weather: what stops the ride,

23
00:01:03.497 --> 00:01:06.590
and when does your deposit become non-refundable?

24
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.995
Compare two or three quotes side by side.

25
00:01:10.264 --> 00:01:13.590
The cheapest headline price is rarely the cheapest quote.

26
00:01:13.996 --> 00:01:15.172
Reach out early.

27
00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:19.290
Operators book a season at a time, so contact several.

28
00:01:19.642 --> 00:01:21.760
Find carnival rides near your event

29
00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.010
at carnivalriderental.us.
